If 3 EOR 100000 Then NPrint "if-eor-cb-cl-A T" Else NPrint "if-eor-cb-cl-A F"
If 1000 EOR vb Then NPrint "if-eor-cw-b-A T" Else NPrint "if-eor-cw-b-A F"
