If 100000 EOR 100000 Then NPrint "if-eor-cl-cl-A T" Else NPrint "if-eor-cl-cl-A F"
If vb LSL nb Then NPrint "if-lsl-b-b-A T" Else NPrint "if-lsl-b-b-A F"
